# --- Milestone 1 handoff: these are DELIVERABLES here, not build output ---
# The kernel ships prebuilt (there is no source and no Makefile to rebuild it), so
# the upstream rules above -- which correctly treat these as artifacts in a source
# tree -- must not apply. Without these three lines a clone has no kernel, no disk
# image and no symbol table, and nothing boots.
!fs.img
!kernel/kernel
!kernel/kernel.sym
!user/usys.S
